From: filhoDaMain <temprilho93@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 11 Aug 2025 16:29:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rpi_3_32b_defconfig: disable boot delay
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]

---
 configs/rpi_3_32b_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/rpi_3_32b_defconfig b/configs/rpi_3_32b_defconfig
index 0ccc93d572b..a8e3c556eac 100644
--- a/configs/rpi_3_32b_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rpi_3_32b_defconfig
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ CONFIG_CUSTOM_SYS_INIT_SP_ADDR=0x7ffff00
 CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x4000
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="bcm2837-rpi-3-b"
 CONFIG_OF_LIBFDT_OVERLAY=y
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=-2
 CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR=0x1000000
 CONFIG_BOOTSTD_DEFAULTS=y
 CONFIG_OF_BOARD_SETUP=y
